text = " Element: Fire

 Astrology: The Sun 
(celestial center of life, 
 ego, consciousness, and 
 vitality)"

[node name="LeftDescription" parent="Pages/GrimoirePage4" index="6" unique_id=1952948361]
text = "           Golden radiance, absolute clarity, and 
           triumphant success. The Sun brings 
           brilliant warmth, forcing the seeker to 
        see right through complex riddles with 
     childlike joy. It represents a peak era 
 where everything the traveler touches 
 bursts into glorious bloom."

[node name="RightTitle" parent="Pages/GrimoirePage4" index="7" unique_id=1317776254]
offset_left = 1151.0
offset_top = 265.0
offset_right = 1387.0
offset_bottom = 490.0
text = " Element: Fire

 Astrology: Aries 
 (leadership, pioneering 
 spirit, and raw authority)
"

[node name="RightDescription" parent="Pages/GrimoirePage4" index="8" unique_id=241163254]
offset_bottom = 747.0
text = " Regal structure, stubborn stability, and the 
 weaving of protective boundaries. This card 
represents the rock-solid foundations required 
 to build a lasting legacy. It calls upon the 
 seeker to summon their inner discipline and 
 organize a chaotic environment into a 
 well-regulated regime."

